        "created_at": "2015-09-12T22:16:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I remember beating Losing to the Odds and The New Deal with Sky Scrapper and Guise in play, 3 Heroes. I don't remember exactly how it went but it was a double Thortarian Monolith and basically administring the damage made it so we ended with all even HP.</p><p>You didn't mention the Heroes or number of players so maybe it was unnwinnable, maybe Wager Master shenanigans were overlooked. He is basically a Villain you beat by playing the rules more than the game.</p>",
