        "created_at": "2015-09-12T22:53:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wager Master can lose due to his own cards on his first turn potentially. &nbsp; Most of his conditions will flip if you meet certain requirements and getting him to flip over helps immensely since they'll all flip over. &nbsp; I'm not saying I'll play him frequently but he is the most interesting/ challenging mini expansion villain so far. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
