        "created_at": "2015-09-18T23:28:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>4 heroes. Can’t remember the setup. But issues is the same regardless of hero team size. Those 3 cards in that order prevents winning because no winning condition can be meet other then losing. And when we did flip him he revealed the same 3 cards in the same order causing a unbeatable sitaution. And this has happened to us every time we played him.</p>",
